Change: @fixture/pay 1.4.0 -> 2.0.0 (breaking, major)
The manifests and lockfiles already point at the new version.

Upstream:

[releases] v2.0.0
https://github.com/fixture/pay/releases/tag/v2.0.0
## Breaking

- `charges.*` was replaced by `paymentIntents.*`.
- `charges.list` is gone; use `paymentIntents.list`.

[registry] 1.4.0 deprecated


Already applied where they matched, do not redo:
- rename charges.create -> paymentIntents.create

Files you may edit:
- package.json
- src/billing.js

